# Build context for the MT5 collector image (context: ., see
# docker-compose.prod.yml). Only collector/ and deploy/docker/m1m5-mt5-collector/
# are COPYed, but without this file the WHOLE repository was sent as context
# and `COPY collector/ /app/` baked collector/.env.production -- including the
# MT5 account password -- into the image.
#
# No env file belongs in any image: every service receives its configuration at
# runtime through `env_file` in docker-compose.prod.yml.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
backend/dist
frontend/.next
